{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act3d0_level_act3d0_06_end",
  "groupId": "act3d0",
  "stageId": "a003_06",
  "title": "殺手女皇",
  "storyCode": "OF-6",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act3d0/level_act3d0_06_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "c2269b0518cbab978b9e2af4e469a36a0f540c187b939bf01c3ebb483623d475",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第六关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "text": "全、全都打倒了？我從來......都不知道你有這麼厲害。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "text": "我也想像過，但......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "所以我不想讓小姐知道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "text": "但你實在是太厲害了！好帥呀，黑！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "唔。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "text": "你是怎麼跳那麼高的！順著牆竄上去，然後直接翻身躍下！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "text": "就在空中這麼旋轉，所有射擊都被你躲過去了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "text": "然後扭過身體，啪啪啪，連著把他們全都射倒！天哪！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "小姐......你這麼說，我的臉會很燙。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "text": "不過，黑，我要糾正一點。剛才我可沒有在命令你，我只是作為朋友在請求你而已。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "text": "你如果有什麼想做的事情，也可以和我說呀。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "明白。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "text": "嗯？我們剛才怎麼說來著？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "......啊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "text": "別這麼說話！朋友，是朋友！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "我......好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "text": "呵呵。我們快去市政廳吧，不知道博士他們那裡現在是什麼情況......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛寧",
      "text": "這些飯桶，連一個小姑娘都攔不住嗎？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛寧的保鏢",
      "text": "可她是薩卡茲！而且對方還有其他好幾個人！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛寧",
      "text": "那不也就只有幾個人！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛寧",
      "text": "可、可惡的羅德島，怎麼會在這裡！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅豆",
      "text": "什麼嘛，感覺這些傢伙，怎麼比源石蟲還弱的樣子......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛寧",
      "text": "趕快把所有的人手都調過來！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛寧的保鏢",
      "text": "可是克洛寧先生......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛寧的保鏢",
      "text": "我覺得，打不過，就是打不過！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛寧",
      "text": "沒什麼可是！別往後退啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅豆",
      "text": "呵欠......唉，博士，你找到沒有啊？我還要去聽LIVE呢，要是趕不上我可就虧大了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我得到了！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "嗯，已經找到帳簿和債券了。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "紅豆",
          "text": "哦？找到了啊？果然打他們一頓是有用的嘛。隕星姐也說了，暴力有時候是必要的！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "克洛寧",
          "text": "該，該死！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "克洛寧",
          "text": "不管了，只要現在能逃走，手續什麼的好補得很！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "紅豆",
          "text": "啊，博士，他從窗戶逃走了！",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "這些資料，我們把它都帶上！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "紅豆",
          "text": "好~",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "紅豆",
          "text": "咦，將軍他還在外面吧？感覺這個克洛寧什麼的下場會很慘啊，還不如沒逃走呢......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "紅豆",
          "text": "來，博士，我幫你拿！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "克洛寧",
          "text": "哈，哈哈......該死。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "克洛寧",
          "text": "必須，必須馬上把其他人叫回來！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫拉格",
          "text": "上一次，羅德島的博士和貴市的錫蘭小姐從那個窗戶跳了出來。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫拉格",
          "text": "時來運轉，現在是汐斯塔的天災信使克洛寧先生跳出了窗戶。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫拉格",
          "text": "人生也許很無常，先生。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "克洛寧",
          "text": "你......你！我的手下呢？我的手下呢？！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫拉格",
          "text": "放在這裡會影響遊客參觀。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫拉格",
          "text": "順便，這兩位小姐已經在這裡等你很久了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "克洛寧",
          "text": "黑......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "克洛寧",
          "text": "你們兩個站在一起，也就是說......",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "也就是說你要完蛋了！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "證據現在都在我們手中，你難逃法網了，先生。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫拉格",
          "text": "博士，請小心，他也許還會做些垂死掙扎。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "克洛寧",
          "text": "你們......你們......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "錫蘭",
          "text": "你的計畫敗露了，克洛寧！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
